## Project Objectives

Development of an AI-driven grid management system for utility companies, enabling real-time optimization of power distribution, demand response, and renewable energy integration.

### Key Deliverables
1. Grid optimization software platform
2. Demand response management system
3. Renewable integration module
4. Utility operations dashboard
5. Consumer engagement app

